# GSD planning artifacts (PLAN/CONTEXT/PATTERNS/SUMMARY .md files) are structured
# prompts containing XML-ish tags and bare code identifiers, not prose. Prettier's
# markdown formatter parses `__tests__` as bold and `<read_first>` as emphasis,
# silently rewriting them to `**tests**` and `<read*first>` — which corrupts file
# paths and tag names that downstream GSD tooling and executors read literally.
# Observed corrupting Phase 44 plans on 2026-08-23.
